docs {
Kirim pantun suara (50-api-pantun.md). Multipart: audio wajib,
duration_ms 10000-60000. lines opsional ([] = voice-only; 4 baris = teks+audio).
Rate limit audio: 10/jam/user.
}

meta {
  name: Create Pantun Audio
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pantuns/audio
  body: multipartForm
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

body:multipart-form {
  lines: []
  language: id
  duration_ms: 12000
  audio: @file(/tmp/pantun-sample.wav)
}
